{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.habiro_tail_poly","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.habiro_tail_poly","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L149-L153","doc":"The Habiro-tail polynomial identity (division-free, generic `CommRing`):\n`q⁴ + 1 − q³ − q = (q−1)²·Φ₃`, `Φ₃ = q² + q + 1`. This is `q²·D(4)` after the\nsymmetric brackets are cleared — the `n = 4` deviation's exact cyclotomic form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.D4_habiro_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.D4_habiro_factor","kind":"theorem","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L135-L140","doc":"**Habiro cyclotomic signature.** Clearing `q²`, the `n = 4` deviation is\n`(q−1)²·Φ₃` with `Φ₃ = q²+q+1` cyclotomic and the universal `(q−1)²` double\nroot at `q = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.D4_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.D4_eq","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L129-L133","doc":"`D(4) = S(4) − (S(3) + [3]_q·S(2)) = (q² + q⁻²) − (q + q⁻¹)`, the first\nnonzero deviation from the naive `[n−1]_q` recurrence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.qbr2_classical_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.qbr2_classical_limit","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L123-L125","doc":"At `q = 1`, `[2]_q = 2` — the classical involution recurrence coefficient\n`I(3) = I(2) + 2·I(1)` (the `n−1 = 2` weight). Ties Tier 1 to A000085. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.D3_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.D3_zero","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L119-L121","doc":"Recurrence exact at `n = 3`: `D(3) = S(3) − (S(2) + [2]_q·S(1)) = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.c3_eq_qbr2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.c3_eq_qbr2","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L114-L117","doc":"**`c₃ = [2]_q` exactly** — the single nontrivial seed coincidence.\n`c₃ = (S(3) − S(2)) / S(1) = S(3) − S(2)` since `S(1) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.D2_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.D2_zero","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L110-L112","doc":"Recurrence exact at `n = 2`: `D(2) = S(2) − (S(1) + [1]_q·S(0)) = 0`,\nwith `[1]_q = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.c2_seed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.c2_seed","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L107-L108","doc":"`c₂ = (S(2) − S(1))/S(0) = 1 = [1]_q` (near-trivial; `S(0)=1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.S4","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L102-L103","doc":"`S(4) = 2 + 2[3]_q + (q² + q⁻²)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.S3","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L100-L101","doc":"`S(3) = 2 + [2]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.S2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.S2","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L98-L99","doc":"`S(2) = 2` (q-independent). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.S1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.S1","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L96-L97","doc":"`S(1) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.S0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.S0","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L94-L95","doc":"`S(0) = 1` (empty partition). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.qbr3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.qbr3","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L89-L90","doc":"Symmetric `[3]_q = q² + 1 + q⁻²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.qbr2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.qbr2","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingEigenfunctionTwoTier.lean#L86-L87","doc":"Symmetric `[2]_q = q + q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}